@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<main aria-labelledby="title" style="margin-bottom: 2em;">
    <h2 id="title">@ViewBag.Title</h2>
    <hr />
    <div style="width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-content: center; justify-items:center;">
        <div style="margin-top: 2em; margin-bottom: 6em;  width: 80%; ">
            <p style="font-weight: 600;">
                Welcome to our job finder portal! We are a company dedicated to helping job seekers find the perfect employment
                opportunity, and employers find the perfect candidates for their open positions.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: 600;">
                At our core, we believe that everyone deserves the chance to pursue a fulfilling career, and that employers
                should have access to the best and brightest talent available. That's why we've created a platform that connects
                job seekers with employers in an easy and intuitive way.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: 600;">
                Our team is made up of experienced professionals who are passionate about helping others achieve their career
                goals. We are committed to providing exceptional service to both job seekers and employers, and we strive to make
                the hiring process as efficient and stress-free as possible.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: 600;">
                Whether you're a recent graduate looking for your first job, or an experienced professional seeking a new
                challenge, we are here to help. Our job finder portal offers a wide range of job opportunities in a variety of
                industries, so you can find the perfect fit for your skills and experience.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: 600;">
                We are dedicated to helping job seekers and employers succeed, and we believe that our job finder portal is
                the perfect solution for anyone looking to take the next step in their career. Thank you for choosing us as your
                partner in the job search process.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>